26人死亡，当中25人为印度公民。印度首都新德里等地26日继续爆发示威，要求政府严肃处理事件。 此前，印度军队25日突袭了两名袭击事件嫌疑人在印控克什米尔地区的住所。目击者指，士兵封锁了两条路，疏散了所有邻居，随后将房子洗劫一空并用炸药炸毁，爆炸还波及了附近几处民房。巴方指责印度未事先通知突然开闸泄洪，巴基斯坦多地水位大幅上升"},"attached_info":"CkkI25La74rpm9VeEAMaCTExNDcwNDcwNiDzhLfABjAAOB9AFHITMTg5OTgxOTI3MTEyNDY0MTM0MHgAqgEJYmlsbGJvYXJk0gEA","detail_text":"57 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://picx.zhimg.com/80/v2-c5dfa585c81fad2a4716639aff69d4e6_720w.png"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"21_1745742146.87252","card_id":"Q_1899433144995779412","target":{"id":1899433144995779300,"title":"当行业还在拼低价时，美的是否用 AI 重新定义了空调硬实力？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1899433144995779412","type":"question","created":1745640151,"answer_count":29,"follower_count":43,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[36244,300505,595411,3942276,3949471],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":"美的空调开启的新一轮「AI+科技」战略升级，为全球用户提供更高质量、更高体验的智能产品和服务，谈谈你眼中的美的空调 AI 科技，这场 AI 变革是否能让行业的游戏规则被改写？"},"attached_info":"CkkI25La74rpm9VeEAMaCTExNDY4ODkyNCDXtbHABjAAOCtAFXITMTg5OTQzMzE0NDk5NTc3OTQxMngAqgEJYmlsbGJvYXJk0gEA","detail_text":"57 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-9f73fb2a73922e90e508d30a20c7732f_b.jpg"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"22_1745742146.87743","card_id":"Q_1896985411252880047","target":{"id":1896985411252880100,"title":"卡缪·比丹到底有多强？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1896985411252880047","type":"question","created":1745056566,"answer_count":17,"follower_count":28,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[32112,219464,685773],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":""},"attached_info":"CkkI25La74rpm9VeEAMaCTExNDU4MTA